      "text": "In the Federal area, this problem was dealt with by the Hatch Act which represented a considerable improvement over the political and governmental practices which existed at the time of its passage. (Title 5, U.S.C. Sections 1501-1508); Sections 7321-7327). When the challenge to the constitutionality of that law came before the Supreme Court of the United States, the Court said:",
